    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Smash Blades</i></strong> is a 2-6 player  couch/online physics-based top-down 3D party fighting game. Swing your weapon with your joystick/mouse to knock everyone else out of the field. Your blade may be blocked by others' blade. So, what you can do, is to <strong>smash</strong> their <strong>blade</strong> defence with your <strong>blade</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Unique Charm of Smash Blades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think back to all the cinematic duels you've seen: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clashing sounds, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glint of blades, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tense standoff between duelists\u2014 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blades locked in combat, </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting for the perfect moment\u2014 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, victory is decided. </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This exhilarating experience is what makes Smash Blades truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/d8bfb4091b4bd9975f354e4e9896543c.poster.avif?t=1748590841\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/d8bfb4091b4bd9975f354e4e9896543c.webm?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/d8bfb4091b4bd9975f354e4e9896543c.mp4?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinctive Minimalist Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its uniqueness doesn't stem from a jumble of complex ideas; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It comes from one truly brilliant concept\u2014 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Swing</u></strong> your mouse or move your joystick; </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the weapon dances in your hands. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's it. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities arise from these simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/d77fc83af35b99f622cf645925dde8e3.poster.avif?t=1748590841\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/d77fc83af35b99f622cf645925dde8e3.webm?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/d77fc83af35b99f622cf645925dde8e3.mp4?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamless Offense and Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flexible control scheme gives the game a rich strategic depth\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With each flick and pull of the mouse or controller, offense and defense become one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/47af2f1b287d57b523c1c8d7a717f6aa.poster.avif?t=1748590841\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/47af2f1b287d57b523c1c8d7a717f6aa.webm?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/47af2f1b287d57b523c1c8d7a717f6aa.mp4?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Mayhem: Watch Your Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your friends; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the grand melee! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easy to dodge an open attack, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but beware the hidden strike\u2014 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for that sneaky friend lurking behind you, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to land a surprise blow on your backside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/414b4f1cc3d308e7e4fb83c59be618a1.poster.avif?t=1748590841\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/414b4f1cc3d308e7e4fb83c59be618a1.webm?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/414b4f1cc3d308e7e4fb83c59be618a1.mp4?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Weapons &amp; Arenas &amp; Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong><u>WEAPON</u></strong> has different physics characteristics; </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shape; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weight; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >damage; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining a variety of <strong><u>SKILLS</u></strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in different <strong><u>MAP</u></strong> scenarios, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with differently equipped <strong><u>TEAMMATES</u></strong>, under a wide variety of <strong><u>RULES</u></strong> in different arenas, against differently equipped <strong><u>OPPONENTS</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/b527ff2b0d0940ca2c39156dbeac5098.poster.avif?t=1748590841\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/b527ff2b0d0940ca2c39156dbeac5098.webm?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755880/extras/b527ff2b0d0940ca2c39156dbeac5098.mp4?t=1748590841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More maps are in development; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more diverse arsenal of weapons; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More intriguing mechanics and skills; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>STAY TUNED FOR MORE EXCITEMENT!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
